{"speciesId":96,"names":{"fr":"Soporifik","es":"Drowzee","en":"Drowzee","ja":"スリープ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"Puts enemies to sleep then eats their dreams. Occasionally gets sick from eating bad dreams."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"Puts enemies to sleep then eats their dreams. Occasionally gets sick from eating bad dreams."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"If you sleep by it all the time, it will sometimes show you dreams it has eaten in the past."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"If you think that you had a good dream, but you can't remember it, a DROWZEE has probably eaten it."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It remembers every dream it eats. It rarely eats the dreams of adults because children's are much tastier."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"When it twitches its nose, it can tell where someone is sleeping and what that person is dreaming about."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"If your nose becomes itchy while you are sleeping, it’s a sure sign that one of these POKéMON is standing above your pillow and trying to eat your dream through your nostrils."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"If your nose becomes itchy while you are sleeping, it’s a sure sign that one of these POKéMON is standing above your pillow and trying to eat your dream through your nostrils."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"If your nose becomes itchy while you are sleeping, it’s a sure sign that a DROWZEE is standing above your pillow and trying to eat your dream through your nostrils."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"A descendent of the legendary animal baku, which is said to eat dreams. It is skilled at hypnotism."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Puts enemies to sleep, then eats their dreams. Occasionally gets sick from eating only bad dreams."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It can tell what people are dreaming by sniffing with its big nose. It loves fun dreams."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It can tell what people are dreaming by sniffing with its big nose. It loves fun dreams."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It can tell what people are dreaming by sniffing with its big nose. It loves fun dreams."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"If you think that you had a good dream but you can’t remember it, a DROWZEE has probably eaten it."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It remembers every dream it eats. It rarely eats the dreams of adults because children’s are much tastier."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son grand nez lui permet de lire les rêves d’autrui. Il adore les songes amusants."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It can tell what people are dreaming by sniffing with its big nose. It loves fun dreams."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Son grand nez lui permet de lire les rêves d’autrui. Il adore les songes amusants."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It can tell what people are dreaming by sniffing with its big nose. It loves fun dreams."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It can tell what people are dreaming by sniffing with its big nose. It loves fun dreams."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It can tell what people are dreaming by sniffing with its big nose. It loves fun dreams."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il endort ses ennemis et dévore leurs songes. S’il mange trop de cauchemars, il fait une indigestion."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Adormece a sus enemigos y se come sus sueños. A veces se pone enfermo si come pesadillas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Puts enemies to sleep, then eats their dreams. Occasionally gets sick from eating only bad dreams."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"眠らせては 夢を 食べるが 悪い 夢ばかり 食べてると お腹を 壊すことが あるらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Si vous pensez avoir rêvé mais que vous ne vous en souvenez pas, c’est que Soporifik a tout mangé."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Si crees haber tenido un buen sueño y no puedes acordarte, seguro que se lo ha comido un Drowzee."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"If you think that you had a good dream but you can’t remember it, a Drowzee has probably eaten it."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"楽しい 夢を 見ていたはずなのに どんな夢か 思い出せないとき。 きっと スリープに 食べられたのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lorsque les enfants ont le nez qui les démange en dormant, c’est sans doute parce que ce Pokémon se tient au-dessus de leur oreiller, afin d’essayer de manger leurs rêves par leurs narines."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Si a alguien le pica la nariz mientras duerme, seguro que es porque tiene a uno de estos Pokémon cerca de la almohada intentando sacarle los sueños por la nariz para comérselos."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"If your nose becomes itchy while you are sleeping, it’s a sure sign that one of these Pokémon is standing above your pillow and trying to eat your dream through your nostrils."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"眠っているとき キミの 鼻が ムズムズしたら まくら元に 立った スリープが 鼻の 穴から 夢を 食べようとしている 合図。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lorsque les enfants ont le nez qui les démange en dormant, c’est sans doute parce que ce Pokémon se tient au-dessus de leur oreiller, afin d’essayer de manger leurs rêves par leurs narines."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Si a alguien le pica la nariz mientras duerme, seguro que es porque tiene a uno de estos Pokémon cerca de la almohada intentando sacarle los sueños por la nariz para comérselos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"If your nose becomes itchy while you are sleeping, it’s a sure sign that one of these Pokémon is standing above your pillow and trying to eat your dream through your nostrils."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"眠っているとき キミの 鼻が ムズムズしたら まくら元に 立った スリープが 鼻の 穴から 夢を 食べようとしている 合図。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Un Pokémon qui se nourrit de rêves. On suppose qu’il a un ancêtre commun avec Munna et Mushana."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Drowzee se alimenta de sueños. Se cree que comparte antepasados con Munna y Musharna."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"A Pokémon that nourishes itself by eating dreams, it is thought to share common ancestry with Munna and Musharna."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"夢を 喰らって 生きる ポケモン。 ムンナや ムシャーナと 共通の 祖先を 持つと 考えられている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Les rêves agréables ont meilleur goût. S’il vous considère comme un ami, il peut transformer les vôtres en ceux qu’il a trouvés les plus délicieux."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Los sueños divertidos son sus favoritos. Si consigues hacerte su amigo, es posible que te enseñe el sueño más delicioso que haya tenido."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It finds really fun dreams tasty. When it makes friends with people, it may show them the most delicious dreams it’s ever eaten."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"こと 楽しい夢は 美味いらしい。 なつくと 一番 美味しかった 夢を みせてくれることも あるよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il aime musarder près des parcs d’attractions : après y avoir passé une bonne journée, les enfants font de beaux rêves, dont il se délecte."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Se lo puede ver cerca de instalaciones lúdicas donde, al caer la noche, sale a la caza de los sueños de los niños."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It can be spotted near recreational facilities, intending to eat the pleasant dreams of children who enjoyed themselves there that day."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"レジャー施設の 近くで 姿を 見かける。 その晩 子どもが 見る 楽しいユメを 狙って いるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il regarde ses proies dormir et avale leurs rêves. Les cauchemars ayant un petit goût aigrelet, il a tendance à les bouder."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Duerme a sus víctimas para luego devorar sus sueños. Las pesadillas no son de su agrado, ya que al parecer tienen un regusto agrio."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It puts its prey to sleep and devours their dreams. It seems that bad dreams taste sour, so Drowzee doesn’t particularly like eating them."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"獲物を 眠らせ 見ている ユメを 喰らう。 悪いユメは すっぱくて あまり 好んで 食べないらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Si vous dormez tout le temps près de lui, il partagera parfois avec vous les rêves qu’il a dévorés par le passé."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Si se duerme siempre en compañía de un Pokémon de esta especie, puede mostrar sueños que haya ingerido con anterioridad."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"If you sleep by it all the time, it will sometimes show you dreams it had eaten in the past."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"いつも 一緒に 眠ってみると ときどき 昔 食べたユメを 見せてくれる 夜がある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Si vous dormez tout le temps près de lui, il partagera parfois avec vous les rêves qu’il a dévorés par le passé."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Si se duerme siempre en compañía de un Pokémon de esta especie, puede mostrar sueños que haya ingerido con anterioridad."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"If you sleep by it all the time, it will sometimes show you dreams it had eaten in the past."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"いつも 一緒に 眠ってみると ときどき 昔 食べたユメを 見せてくれる 夜がある。"}],"varieties":[{"id":96,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[1,"level-up",1],[2,"level-up",1],[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"l